; A `--permissive` option line takes effect where it appears: an
; assertion written before it is still checked.

2024/01/01 Before
    A                                      1 = 5
    B

--permissive

2024/01/02 After
    A                                      1 = 9
    B

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 5:
While parsing posting:
  A                                      1 = 5
                                             ^
Error: Balance assertion off by 4 (expected to see 1)
end test
